{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"b2474716eadf7b54cbdb4d580e7647242e417d740ffc3b987265a36fc747354d","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_a05f4e45764399999abe78546746c78ff60b97cc38fa5fb3b92ecfe730309c85","overall_assessment":"The paper is well-organized and clearly written, with a logical flow from motivation to method and experiments. The notation is consistent and well-defined, and the algorithmic steps are presented with sufficient detail for reproducibility. The figures and tables are effectively used to support the claims, with clear captions and readable data presentation.","paper_id":"VCAXR34cp59","paper_identity_sha256":"123b9251c04d7c4666c995f558a603b443d945b0fc1c954654ca8678945e4afa","prompt_identity_sha256":"efa318bf09b3e25e22baeb2567fd8e74acf48d1b8bc04a744efbf0e81d129b13","raw_response_sha256":"fc81a40eb535aed015c4ba0563d7201aad07aafb6b2469ff5c6b4575fbeb502e","request_identity_sha256":"69476e05a59f71f1a5c87e5b64084fa111d8ce3a2401e537427ec9ca1e63d393","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"1d1a7ab72db31e0a7a9f8f29377b39dcede5d1d8e08487b09eb92d60597fc1ba","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001","SRC-002","SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-005","SRC-006","SRC-007","SRC-008","SRC-009","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023","SRC-024","SRC-025","SRC-026","SRC-027","SRC-028","SRC-029","SRC-030","SRC-031","SRC-032","SRC-033","SRC-034","SRC-035","SRC-036","SRC-037","SRC-038","SRC-039","SRC-040"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured, with a clear progression from the introduction of the problem to the proposed method and experimental validation. The terminology is precise, and key concepts such as 'disentangled representations' and 'post hoc disentanglement' are clearly defined. The algorithmic